1
00:00:02,069 --> 00:00:05,609
(Raj:)Hey, I read
that someone invented a way

2
00:00:05,606 --> 00:00:08,006
(Raj:)to convert your footsteps
into electromagnetic energy

3
00:00:08,008 --> 00:00:09,908
(Raj:)so you can charge
your cell phone while walking.

4
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:12,180
(Leonard:)We had that idea years ago.

5
00:00:12,179 --> 00:00:14,049
(Leonard:)How come we never
did anything with it?

6
00:00:14,048 --> 00:00:16,618
(Howard:)Probably because we left the
diagram of it in the restaurant,

7
00:00:16,617 --> 00:00:19,017
(Howard:)and none of us
wanted to walk back.

8
00:00:19,019 --> 00:00:22,859
(Sheldon:)I know the real reason you never
made progress with that idea.

9
00:00:22,856 --> 00:00:24,326
(Sheldon:)You thought of it

10
00:00:24,325 --> 00:00:26,325
September 22, 2007.

11
00:00:26,327 --> 00:00:28,757
(Sheldon:)Two days later, Penny moved in,

12
00:00:28,762 --> 00:00:30,862
(Sheldon:)and so much blood rushed
to your genitals,

13
00:00:30,864 --> 00:00:32,694
(Sheldon:)your brain became a ghost town.

14
00:00:34,501 --> 00:00:36,501
(Leonard:)That's not what happened.

15
00:00:36,503 --> 00:00:38,333
(Sheldon:)I remember it distinctly

16
00:00:38,339 --> 00:00:40,609
(Sheldon:)because I had just
composed my annual poem

17
00:00:40,607 --> 00:00:43,547
(Sheldon:)commemorating the anniversary
of Dr. Seuss's death.

18
00:00:43,544 --> 00:00:44,744
(Howard:)No one wants
to hear it.

19
00:00:44,745 --> 00:00:46,245
(Sheldon:)Why, die.

20
00:00:46,246 --> 00:00:47,816
(Sheldon:)Why did he die?

21
00:00:47,815 --> 00:00:49,145
(Sheldon:)Old, told.

22
00:00:49,149 --> 00:00:51,119
(Sheldon:)I was told he was old.

23
00:00:51,118 --> 00:00:54,458
(Leonard:)Penny is not the reason
I didn't pursue that idea.

24
00:00:54,455 --> 00:00:56,585
(Sheldon:)Oh, really?
Since meeting her,

25
00:00:56,590 --> 00:00:58,760
(Sheldon:)what have been
your greatest accomplishments?

26
00:00:58,759 --> 00:00:59,789
KOOTHRAPPALI:
Easy.

27
00:00:59,793 --> 00:01:01,923
(Raj:)Sleeping with Penny.

